# ripgrep (agents' rg, Claude Code's Grep/Glob) and VS Code/Cursor's search panel read this file before .gitignore.
# assets/ is ignored by Git; its small text (receipts, proof descriptions, generation records, prompts: about 6 MB)
# should be searchable, its media (about 9 GB) not. So: bring the folder back, hide all in it, bring back only text.
!/assets/
/assets/**
!/assets/**/
!/assets/**/*.json
!/assets/**/*.txt
!/assets/**/*.md
